    "text": "These former East Salt Lake City area high school standouts will be competing on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nBrinlee McRae\nBlack Hills State Yellow Jackets\nGuard\nSenior\n5′8″\nAlta High School\nHometown: Sandy\nNext Game: vs. Colorado Christian Cougars, Saturday, Dec. 13, 4 p.m.\nJack Wistrcill\nPoint Loma Sea Lions\nForward\nJunior\n6′8″ 225\nOlympus High School\nHometown: Salt Lake City\nNext Game: vs. Dominican Penguins, Saturday, Dec. 13, 4 p.m.\nLuke Meyer\nIllinois Wesleyan Titans\nCenter\nFreshman\n6′9″\nJuan Diego Catholic High School\nHometown: Highland\nNext Game: vs. Elmhurst Bluejays, Saturday, Dec. 13, 4:15 p.m.\nYorgio Golesis\nFort Lewis Skyhawks\nGuard\nJunior\n6′1″ 180\nSkyline High School\nHometown: Salt Lake City\nNext Game: vs. Adams State Grizzlies, Saturday, Dec. 13, 12 a.m.",
